{"step_index":1501,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T02:33:46Z","thinking":"**Verifying Email Address Deliverability**\n\nThe user's question requires determining if an email address, specifically `hyeree.amazon@gmail.com`, is valid and able to receive mail. This can be achieved through techniques that test the email server's responsiveness without sending a full email. A DNS MX record lookup is required to identify the target mail servers. Subsequent SMTP handshake could verify the mail server's readiness to receive.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e '\nconst dns = require(\"dns\");\nconst net = require(\"net\");\n\nconst email = \"hyeree.amazon@gmail.com\";\nconst domain = email.split(\"@\")[1];\n\ndns.resolveMx(domain, (err, addresses) => {\n  if (err || !addresses.length) {\n    console.log(\"DNS MX Error:\", err);\n    return;\n  }\n  addresses.sort((a, b) => a.priority - b.priority);\n  const mxHost = addresses[0].exchange;\n  console.log(\"MX Host:\", mxHost);\n\n  const socket = net.createConnection(25, mxHost);\n  socket.setEncoding(\"utf-8\");\n  socket.setTimeout(10000);\n\n  let step = 0;\n  socket.on(\"data\", (data) => {\n    console.log(\"S:\", data.trim());\n    if (step === 0 && data.startsWith(\"220\")) {\n      step++;\n      socket.write(\"HELO check.com\\r\\n\");\n    } else if (step === 1 && data.startsWith(\"250\")) {\n      step++;\n      socket.write(\"MAIL FROM:<test@check.com>\\r\\n\");\n    } else if (step === 2 && data.startsWith(\"250\")) {\n      step++;\n      socket.write(`RCPT TO:<${email}>\\r\\n`);\n    } else if (step === 3) {\n      console.log(\"FINAL RCPT RESULT:\", data.trim());\n      socket.write(\"QUIT\\r\\n\");\n      socket.end();\n    }\n  });\n\n  socket.on(\"error\", (err) => {\n    console.log(\"Socket error:\", err.message);\n  });\n  socket.on(\"timeout\", () => {\n    console.log(\"Socket timeout (port 25 likely blocked by ISP)\");\n    socket.destroy();\n  });\n});\n'","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\resilient-bardeen","WaitMsBeforeAsync":12000,"toolAction":"Checking SMTP deliverability for hyeree.amazon@gmail.com","toolSummary":"Test email deliverability"}}]}
